  "html": "\u003C!DOCTYPE HTML PUBLIC \u0022-//W3C//DTD HTML 4.01 Transitional//EN\u0022 \u0022http://www.w3.org/TR/html4/loose.dtd\u0022\u003E\n\n\u003CHTML\u003E\u003CHEAD\u003E\n\u003CMETA name=GENERATOR content=\u0022MSHTML 11.00.10570.1001\u0022\u003E\u003C/HEAD\u003E\n\u003CBODY style=\u0022MARGIN: 0.5em\u0022\u003E\n\u003CP class=MsoNormal style=\u0022FONT-SIZE: small; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(34,34,34); FONT-STYLE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; \ntext-decoration-color: initial\u0022\u003EOl\u0026aacute;,\u003C/P\u003E\n\u003CP class=MsoNormal style=\u0022FONT-SIZE: small; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FONT-WEIGHT: 400; COLOR: rgb(34,34,34); FONT-STYLE: normal; ORPHANS: 2; WIDOWS: 2; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(255,255,255); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; \ntext-decoration-color: initial\u0022\u003E\u003CBR\u003EEspero que esteja bem. Precisamos urgentemente dos modelos em anexo da sua empresa.\u003CBR\u003EGostaria de solicitar um or\u0026ccedil;amento hoje para dar prosseguimento ao pedido do nosso cliente. Tentamos entrar em contato com sua equipe por telefone, mas n\u0026atilde;o conseguimos. Por favor, confirme a quantidade m\u0026aacute;xima que pode ser fornecida imediatamente.\u003CBR\u003E\u003CBR\u003EPor favor, analise o pedido e responda ainda hoje.\u003CBR\u003E\n\u003CSPAN style=\u0022FONT-SIZE: 10pt; FONT-FAMILY: Arial, sans-serif; COLOR: navy\